{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16797","headline":"赋得沈珠於泉 · 独孤良器","name":"赋得沈珠於泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皎洁沈泉水，荧煌照乘珠。\n沈非将宝契，还与不贪符。\n风折璿成浪，空涵影似浮。\n深看星幷入，静向月同无。\n光价怜时重，亡情信道枢。\n不应无胫至，自爲暗投殊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤良器","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16797.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16797","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}